                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "559cd056-e4fd-33aa-8ee3-449fe909b7c0",
                        "entry_id": "ca92a684-d579-3c7e-a442-fb4733a7d808",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eine Rede, die dazu eingesetzt wird, jemanden oder etwas positiv herauszustellen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d738e34b-2b35-4a3d-a569-6ee0ca15a8ba",
                                "sense_id": "559cd056-e4fd-33aa-8ee3-449fe909b7c0",
                                "text": "„Im weiteren Sinn ist die Schmährede eine Form der Rede wie die Lobrede und somit ein Mittel der Rhetorik, das zum Beispiel in Theaterstücken gerne eingesetzt wird.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d01c605e-b851-4a85-bad1-702a0b31dfd6",
                                "sense_id": "559cd056-e4fd-33aa-8ee3-449fe909b7c0",
                                "text": "„Da mußte Nanetta erst recht lachen; aber ich blieb bei meiner ernsten Miene und änderte auch mein Verhalten gegen Martina nicht, sondern hielt die hochtrabendsten Lobreden auf ihre schöne Aufrichtigkeit.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e60aabf-2fef-4219-83ca-de827e531392",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca92a684-d579-3c7e-a442-fb4733a7d808",
                        "source_sense_id": "559cd056-e4fd-33aa-8ee3-449fe909b7c0",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine Rede, die dazu eingesetzt wird, jemanden oder etwas positiv herauszustellen",
                        "target_lang_word": "eulogy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eulogy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "360cfd4c-13b8-3749-bb69-7549a0dad7dc",
                                        "entry_id": "a1471620-5caf-39aa-8aa0-56efa47e833d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An oration to honor a deceased person, usually at a funeral."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a300d9f6-25e2-3ed1-a5fe-594e391d960a",
                                        "entry_id": "a1471620-5caf-39aa-8aa0-56efa47e833d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Speaking highly of someone or something; the act of praising or commending someone or something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08b2e960-8f07-48c8-9e89-651f10796d32",
                                                "sense_id": "a300d9f6-25e2-3ed1-a5fe-594e391d960a",
                                                "text": "It was the prettiest and most luxurious little sitting-room I had ever seen; and I admired it with the warmest enthusiasm. The solemn servant was far too highly trained to betray the slightest satisfaction. He bowed with icy deference when my terms of eulogy were all exhausted, and silently opened the door for me to go out into the passage again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d54f5940-6128-422e-b028-804043775fb3",
                                                "sense_id": "a300d9f6-25e2-3ed1-a5fe-594e391d960a",
                                                "text": "The Southampton striker, who also struck a post late on, was being serenaded by the Wembley crowd before the end and should probably brace himself for some Lambert-mania over the coming days but, amid the eulogies, it should not overlook the deficiencies that were evident in another stodgy England performance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "257aadfa-fb86-4062-9fd0-0ef1ec4700a5",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca92a684-d579-3c7e-a442-fb4733a7d808",
                        "source_sense_id": "559cd056-e4fd-33aa-8ee3-449fe909b7c0",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine Rede, die dazu eingesetzt wird, jemanden oder etwas positiv herauszustellen",
                        "target_lang_word": "panegyric",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "panegyric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dc47dbd-6fbd-358f-b388-5258dc21ec72",
                                        "entry_id": "e9f6b407-b01d-326a-b5bd-a3a5a04d9cca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal speech publicly praising someone or something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd16804a-6135-4f1e-a827-900f350a7c35",
                                                "sense_id": "4dc47dbd-6fbd-358f-b388-5258dc21ec72",
                                                "text": "My little Friend Grildrig, you have made a moſt admirable Panegyrick upon your Country: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28a8ccc6-82b8-4ba6-890c-df1965532842",
                                                "sense_id": "4dc47dbd-6fbd-358f-b388-5258dc21ec72",
                                                "text": "Want of something else to say, and a very shady lane, disposed him to confidence; and he forthwith began a panegyric on himself, and on the good fortune of Miss Arundel, stating, he was now on his road to offer himself and his debts to her acceptance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11c47b17-f6db-40cd-bf3c-06dae617db4d",
                                                "sense_id": "4dc47dbd-6fbd-358f-b388-5258dc21ec72",
                                                "text": "The painter's absurd fits of jealousy, his wild devotion, his extravagant panegyrics, his curious reticences—he understood them all now, and he felt sorry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fd18d65-51e3-4352-8480-b901a57e9e12",
                                                "sense_id": "4dc47dbd-6fbd-358f-b388-5258dc21ec72",
                                                "text": "He then spoke in the usual boastful manner of his progenitors, added a flaming panegyric upon himself, and strolled down the road to repeat his speech at the next house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59c05215-52af-4ae0-9653-9688e5640b52",
                                                "sense_id": "4dc47dbd-6fbd-358f-b388-5258dc21ec72",
                                                "text": "Another manifestation, significantly reaching its apogee in the midst of Antonine virtues, was the growing popularity of adoxographical exercises. Mock panegyrics were dashed off, not just by sardonic intellectuals such as Lucian, but also by trained courtiers and polished encomiasts of the stamp of [Marcus Cornelius] Fronto."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "778e99bb-c94b-3594-bd15-442380a0fb6d",
                                        "entry_id": "e9f6b407-b01d-326a-b5bd-a3a5a04d9cca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who writes or delivers such a speech."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "panegyric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a171c253-206f-3b2e-b880-fab6a94dd2a6",
                                        "entry_id": "833571dd-3136-3713-95f1-fc63163f8a62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "panegyrical"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "434f028b-9ce5-418e-8e02-29bbb8baa10a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca92a684-d579-3c7e-a442-fb4733a7d808",
                        "source_sense_id": "559cd056-e4fd-33aa-8ee3-449fe909b7c0",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine Rede, die dazu eingesetzt wird, jemanden oder etwas positiv herauszustellen",
                        "target_lang_word": "éloge",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "éloge",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16f755b7-21bc-3e95-b814-fa0dbbc22b2d",
                                        "entry_id": "9bf8ad5b-7801-3b63-9219-43624401ced4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Discours à la louange de quelqu’un ou de quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1f322d4-c090-4a79-8f97-e1ca87d3daeb",
                                                "sense_id": "16f755b7-21bc-3e95-b814-fa0dbbc22b2d",
                                                "text": "En vain je portai aux nues la qualité de leur lait, en vain j'assurai que je n'en avais bu de meilleur, mes éloges ne me valurent aucun répit, et je dus me gorger de lait […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "024edc09-a57a-4455-b3b6-3365e7f38dd7",
                                                "sense_id": "16f755b7-21bc-3e95-b814-fa0dbbc22b2d",
                                                "text": "Sur quoi, M. de Bernage se répandit en éloges et en protestations de dévouement à la noble entreprise patronnée par la dame, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84d1fda0-6f76-4245-b4e3-e959f1066dc8",
                                                "sense_id": "16f755b7-21bc-3e95-b814-fa0dbbc22b2d",
                                                "text": "Les pompiers de Monthois et de Mouron, avec un zèle et une vigueur dignes d’éloges, attaquèrent l'incendie et parvinrent à préserver l’auberge de Mme Cbarbogne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb09907f-8b8d-455f-b8db-c539cf97c769",
                                                "sense_id": "16f755b7-21bc-3e95-b814-fa0dbbc22b2d",
                                                "text": "Je quitte Dollero tout heureux car, au milieu de ses éloges, il a, prétend-il, trouvé une épigramme, inspirée par Epitalion, le maréchal des logis du commandant Gérard, qui a envie de se fiancer: […]. Je l'attriste en soutenant que c'est encore un éloge et pas une épigramme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfcd53a1-ff3d-4135-b732-efbb7300ed48",
                                                "sense_id": "16f755b7-21bc-3e95-b814-fa0dbbc22b2d",
                                                "text": "Chacun tenant à rester sur la défensive, le silence se prolongeait quand le Carcan, pour rompre cette gêne, trouva un moyen terme et entama l’éloge du vin qui restait dans son verre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c09b949-4b11-3424-820e-c5745e5d0d23",
                                        "entry_id": "9bf8ad5b-7801-3b63-9219-43624401ced4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Louange."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c79764a1-56e5-4d5e-8fd7-e8898b3c2387",
                                                "sense_id": "5c09b949-4b11-3424-820e-c5745e5d0d23",
                                                "text": "Les journalistes, dont il récompensait, de son vivant, les tumultueux éloges, se taisent aujourd'hui. Nous pouvons parler de l'homme sans soulever des récriminations à gages et des tempêtes soldées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80dad2b5-c41b-43b6-a789-59e4384080d9",
                                                "sense_id": "5c09b949-4b11-3424-820e-c5745e5d0d23",
                                                "text": "Aussi la duchesse avait-elle conservé ces lettres émouvantes, comme certains vieillards ont des gravures obscènes, à cause des éloges hyperboliques donnés à ce qu’elle avait de moins duchesse en elle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
